; The report is asked for by the program, not by the environment. Without --profile, ProfileFPS and the other commands do nothing.
Graphics 64, 64, 0, 2
ProfileEnable 1
ProfileFPS 1
ProfileSample ""
Local start = MilliSecs()
While MilliSecs() - start < 1300
	Cls
	Flip
Wend
ProfileFPS 0
End
